---
---

<footer class="border-t border-slate-800/80 bg-[#070a12] py-12 text-sm text-slate-400">
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col gap-10 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:justify-between">
    {/* Left Column: About Block */}
    <div class="max-w-sm space-y-3 shrink-0">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2 group">
        <img
          src="/logo-tight-margin-1024-1024.svg"
          alt="REPL Works"
          class="h-6 w-6 object-contain group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform"
        />
        <span class="font-black tracking-tight text-white group-hover:text-cyan-400 transition-colors">
          REPL Works
        </span>
      </a>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        AI 에이전트와 사람이 프로젝트의 기억과 의도를 문서와 Git에 축적하며 함께
        개발하는 문서 주도 AI 개발 프레임워크.
      </p>
      <p class="text-[11px] font-mono text-cyan-400/80 font-semibold">
        Models change. Projects survive.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Right Column: 4-Column Sitemap */}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-8 lg:gap-12 w-full lg:w-auto">
      {/* Column 1: Framework */}
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-wider text-slate-200 uppercase">
          Framework
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400">
          <li>
            <a href="/workflow" class="transition hover:text-cyan-400">
              Workflow
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/prompts" class="transition hover:text-cyan-400">
              Prompts
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/documents" class="transition hover:text-cyan-400">
              Documents
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/showcase" class="transition hover:text-cyan-400">
              Showcase
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/faq" class="transition hover:text-cyan-400">
              FAQ
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/replworks/replworks.github.io"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
              class="transition hover:text-cyan-400"
            >
              GitHub
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Column 2: Tools */}
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-wider text-slate-200 uppercase">
          Tools
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400">
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/replworks/repl-cli"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
              class="transition hover:text-cyan-400"
            >
              repl-cli
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/replworks/ai-issue"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
              class="transition hover:text-cyan-400"
            >
              ai-issue
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/replworks/coolrestore"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
              class="transition hover:text-cyan-400"
            >
              coolrestore
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Column 3: Repositories */}
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-wider text-slate-200 uppercase">
          Repositories
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400">
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://apt.repl.net"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
              class="transition hover:text-cyan-400"
            >
              APT - Linux
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://brew.repl.net"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
              class="transition hover:text-cyan-400"
            >
              Homebrew - MacOS
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      {/* Column 4: Live Services */}
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-wider text-slate-200 uppercase">
          Live Services
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400">
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://wifinote.net"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noreferrer"
              class="transition hover:text-cyan-400"
            >
              와이파이 노트
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-7xl border-t border-slate-800/80 px-4 pt-6 text-xs font-mono text-slate-500 sm:px-6 flex items-center justify-between">
    <p>REPL Works · Open Source Framework · MIT License</p>
    <p class="text-cyan-500/60">Built for AI-Native Builders</p>
  </div>
</footer>
